    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk4-phrases-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Recognize restricted paired word patterns",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Learn the fixed paired forms inside their complete words: 一模一样 means exactly alike, 无声无息 means silently, and 有说有笑 describes lively talking and laughing.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "这两本书一模一样。",
                "pinyin": "zhè liǎng běn shū yīmúyīyàng 。",
                "meaning": "These two books are exactly alike.",
                "audio": "3742aafd2e8cd22972597fabfb3992b6df762c97521c9e1c12d48ff0fee66f97"
              },
              {
                "text": "他无声无息地走了。",
                "pinyin": "tā wúshēngwúxī de zǒu le 。",
                "meaning": "He left without a sound.",
                "audio": "c1a9f1d3940f75e20bf855a53a88bb2abb79ade1e6e971ca3b3a744117a112a3"
              },
              {
                "text": "他们有说有笑地回家。",
                "pinyin": "tāmen yǒushuōyǒuxiào de huí jiā 。",
                "meaning": "They went home talking and laughing.",
                "audio": "220b8f7fc0652715bf556633547e7ed8a1ab8251728540ef0bd9bdc4b1abb941"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
